# Generated module map (documentation.nvim). Derived output, not source:
# `:DocMap` rebuilds it from the current tree in seconds — open any file in
# this repo and run it (`:DocMap full` for LuaLS-enriched detail).
# Deliberately not committed. A committed copy is stale the moment anything
# it describes changes, and nothing here gates that (only documentation.nvim
# itself has a CI drift check); measured across these plugins it also came to
# ~40 MB of downloaded artifacts nobody asked for — in several cases larger
# than the plugin's own code.
docs/map/
